		(descr "0.96 inch SPI OLED module HS96L01W4S03 (SSD1315, 128 x 64, Hansheng, LCSC C5139758), 27.3 x 27.8 mm, 4-wire SPI (R3, R4 = 4.7K, R8 = 0R strap as shipped). Header along the top edge, pins left to right, pin 1 (GND) at the origin: 1 GND, 2 VCC, 3 SCL, 4 SDA, 5 RES, 6 DC, 7 CS. Outline, holes (pitch 23.3 x 23.8, dia 2.5) and header from the maker's drawing; glass, viewing area and active area on User.Drawings (window to cut in the faceplate: VA 22.74 x 11.86). Flex tail position is approximate.")
